  m_Name: Grohn_Warning
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: Aye. Power enough to change a person, maybe even enough to face a dragon.
    But power always asks for something back. Be careful, traveller. Between Dibbler,
    the eggs and that valley, someone is hiding the truth.
  option1:
    text: Thanks, Grohn.
    next: {fileID: 0}
    action: 0
  option2:
    text: "I\u2019ll be careful."
